goldenland-realestate-v2 AI Assist architecture (tickets #1–#11):
• Shared ContentSuggestionValidator base for Property/Complex: fixed field set, plain-text title/meta (rejects entity-encoded markup), 60/160/3000 limits, restricted safe-HTML descriptions; Complex never carries sub_description even on failure. Review (#7) → extraction of near-duplicate validator twins + unused helper.
• Bilingual (#8): English synthesized first, lane uses status/accepted_at; Burmese lane adds my_accepted_at + my_error. Property title/content translate; Complex description/meta translate, title stays English-only (non-translatable). ContentTranslationAgent contract + OpenRouter impl; needs 'Translate:ContentSuggestion' permission.
• Image observations (#9/#10): ImageObservation keyed by media_id (Spatie row = version); ImageObservationService::ensure() reuses stored non-failed observations; ImageObservationAgent + OpenRouterImageObservationAgent (strict usable/description/error shape). ContentAgents take `array $observations = []`; generators send observation summaries as text, not raw images. CheckboxList in shared ManagesContentSuggestions trait. Logos never count as evidence; deterministic agents ignore observations (ponytail: noted). Test fakes bundle at provider boundaries: propertyProviderFake() includes imageObservationFake(); complexProviderFake() likewise.
• Web search (#11, in progress): SearchAnchor value object (privacy-safe phrase + official domain; must not call getTranslation on it — Complex title non-translatable would throw), WebSearchAgent + OpenRouter impl (web_search tool, citations on GenerationResponse), WebEvidenceService orchestrator, web_evidence JSON on suggestions, defaults deduped onto AiConfiguration constants. generate() takes web evidence; tests install webSearchFake() in setup. <!-- created=2026-08-07, last=2026-08-07 -->
