goldenland-realestate-v2 test and workflow quirks: (1) Calling `aiAssistAdminUser()` twice in a test registers two `Gate::before` callbacks — the first denies any other user, so call it exactly once per test. (2) Spatie caches `getMedia` per model instance; deleted media stays in the cached collection — use a fresh model instance after media deletion. (3) Filament `fillForm`/`mergeState` merges list state element-wise, so checkbox arrays need a direct `set`. (4) Notification body matching should use `Notification` instance assertions. (5) Review-modal evidence holds in component state but doesn't render server-side into modal HTML — assert on state, not HTML. (6) When adding a new agent fake (e.g. `webSearchFake()`), install it in every test setup where `generate()` runs, or the real agent will run and cause unexpected errors. <!-- created=2026-08-07, last=2026-08-07 -->
